# TYPES.md

Registered concept types.

| Type | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `Concept` | An explained idea |
| `Context` | A curated reading list |
| `Guide` | Step-by-step instructions |
| `Runbook` | Operational procedure |
| `Rule` | A binding statement |
| `Recipe` | Food preparation |
| `Note` | Loose observation |

------
# PROPERTIES.md

Frontmatter properties.

| Property | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `type` | Registered type (required) |
| `description` | One-line summary |
| `title` | Display title |
| `tags` | Registered tags |
| `status` | draft, stable or deprecated |
| `generated` | Provenance: `by`, `at` |
| `verified` | Review entries: `by`, `at` |
| `stale_after` | Datetime after which the page is stale |

